Mumug
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 70 ROTATE 3 U 2
IFUD 5 FACE_HALF
IFUD 0 FACE_HALF
IFUD 2 FACE_LAST
IFUD 3 FACE_LAST
IFUD 8 FACE_LAST
IFUD 7 FACE_LAST
IFUD 0 FACE_LAST
IFUD 9 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE {DRAW, IFUD} IFUD
OR
    AND
        SRC Suit {HEARTS}
        DESTSRC Rank add_14
    DEST Rank K
MOVE_STACK IFUD IFUD
SRCSTACK Size == 2
$win
AND
    AND
        PILE ALL IFUD Empty
        PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    PILE ALL IFUD Empty
